@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title AFTER MVP — Proposed guarded mutation and explicit Sprint-period close
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Authorized caller" as A
participant "Work handler" as H
participant "Current authority contract" as I
database "Owned work / plan / command state" as DB
A -> H : intent + expected relevant versions + command identity
H -> I : resolve current project / action authority
I --> H : current context or denial
H -> DB : resolve command outcome + relevant versioned state
DB --> H : prior outcome / current state / conflict
alt true duplicate with permitted result
 H --> A : same attributable result
else new permitted intent
 H -> H : validate work / relationship / Sprint invariants
 alt ordinary work mutation
  H -> DB : guarded coherent state + ordering + result commit
 else explicit Sprint-period close
  H -> DB : guard plan / items; preserve goal + scope + plan context
  H -> DB : record actual outcomes + reviewed disposition + result
 end
 DB --> H : committed result or conflict
 H --> A : actual outcome; no implicit external action
else denied / invalid / stale state
 H --> A : safe result; no admitted work mutation
end
note over H,DB
 Close steps form the defined consistency boundary, not unrelated commits.
 Grant, plan, item and ordering races need concrete synchronization.
 Lost responses resolve the same command before consequential repeat.
end note
@enduml
